<h3><a title="Science, Technology, &amp; Environment" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/metamajors/meta_science.php"><span><img class="" style="display: block; float: right; margin: 10px auto 10px auto;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/Valentine/metamajor.png" alt="Metamajor Logo" width="150" height="150" /></span></a></h3>
<p><span>The Geology program at Lake Tahoe Community College provides students with general background knowledge in the field of Geology through lecture, lab, and field-based courses.&nbsp;</span><span>Students will gain a broader understanding of their physical environment and the interconnectedness between it and other disciplines. A transfer degree in Geology is available.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
